  "releaseNotes": "v0.10.0. New: a netstandard2.0 asset for .NET Framework 4.8 and other compatible applications, alongside net10.0. Improvements: the provider-neutral contracts and DTOs are available on both targets. Compatibility note: on netstandard2.0, Capabilities uses IReadOnlyCollection and interface members that rely on default implementations under .NET 10 are abstract because .NET Framework does not support default interface methods. Fixes: no standalone defect fixes.",
